title: Inter-Party Relationships
new-page: true
view-if: year <= 1932 and inter_party_relationships_timer <= 0
tags: party_affairs
is-card: true
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; inter_party_relationships_timer = 6;
card-image: img/weimar_coalition_2.jpg
max-visits: 12
#subtitle: Building relations with the other political parties of Germany.

= Inter-Party Relationships

The DDP cannot govern by itself yet. Because we dont have a electoral majority, we need to get the support of the other parties to let us into their coalitions and collaborate, in government or in opposition.

- @dvp: Strengthen our bonds with the <span style="color: #C0A054;">conservative-liberal</span> DVP.
- @center: Strengthen our bonds with the catholic Z.
- @spd: Strengthen our bonds with the SPD.
- @kvp: Strengthen our bonds with the KVP.
- @dnvp: Strenghten our bonds with the DNVP. 
- @bourgeois: Strengthen our bonds with smaller bourgeois parties.
- @ddp_alone: The DDP can stand alone for now.
- @easy_discard


@spd
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; spd_relation += 5*(1 - dissent)
go-to: spd_op if spd_in_government = 1 and ddp_in_government = 0; spd_coalition if spd_in_government = 1 and ddp_in_government = 1; ddp_op if spd_in_government = 0 and ddp_in_government = 1

@spd_op
on-arrival: spd_relation += 5*(1 - dissent)

We are currently in opposition to the SPD-led government, but that does not preclude the general building of feelings of good will.

@spd_coalition
on-arrival: spd_relation += 8*(1 - dissent)

We are currently coalition partners with them, so improving relations comes naturally.

@ddp_op
on-arrival: spd_relation += 5*(1 - dissent)

We hold government without them at present, but the SPD remains a natural partner should the coalition math shift.


@center
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; z_relation += 7*(1 - dissent)

The Zentrum has been one of our closest allies through the course of the Republic.


@dvp
subtitle: -1 resources.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; dvp_relation += 5*(1 - dissent); dvp_left += 1

Many of our members originate from the DVP, and we have contacts within them.


@dvp_op
on-arrival: dvp_relation += 5*(1 - dissent)

They are currently in opposition to our government, but that does not preclude the general building of feelings of good will.


@kvp
subtitle: -1 resources
view-if: kvp_formed = 1
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; kvp_relation += 5*(1 - dissent)

The KVP is a moderate right wing party.


@dnvp
title: [? if dnvp_ideology = "Moderate" and not dnvp_leader = "Treviranus": Increase communications with the national-conservatives from DNVP. ?][? if dnvp_ideology = "Radical" and dvp_ideology = "Right": Collaborate with the anti-democratic rightists from DNVP. ?][? if dnvp_leader = "Treviranus" and dvp_ideology = "Right": Reconcile with the parliamentary turncoats from DNVP. ?][? if dnvp_ideology = "Radical" and dvp_ideology = "Left": Meet with the radical anti-republican rightists from DNVP. ?][? if dnvp_leader = "Treviranus" and dvp_ideology = "Left": Find common ground with the people's conservatives from DNVP. ?]
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; DNVP_relation += 5*(1 - dissent)

[? if dnvp_ideology = "Radical" and dvp_ideology = "Right": Our mutual disdain for the Weimar Republic’s parliamentary catastrophe has made us natural allies with the radicalized DNVP. ?][? if dnvp_ideology = "Moderate" and not dnvp_leader = "Treviranus" and dvp_ideology = "Right": The DNVP’s reluctance to participate in the Reichstag under the moderates has made them a possible ally, despite our differences. ?][? if dnvp_leader = "Treviranus" and dvp_ideology = "Right": Ties with the DNVP have grown increasingly strained with our rapidly diverging views on the Republic, but negotiations are still possible with their nationalistic tendencies. ?][? if dnvp_ideology = "Radical" and dvp_ideology = "Left": Having the DNVP barrel towards rabid anti-parliamentarian tendencies has made any attempts of reconciliation increasingly moot. ?][? if dnvp_ideology = "Moderate" and not dnvp_leader = "Treviranus" and dvp_ideology = "Left": With the DNVP embracing a middle ground between the young parliamentarians and the radicals, perhaps we could find some compromise. ?][? if dnvp_leader = "Treviranus" and dvp_ideology = "Left": Having followed us in our more republican stance, the DNVP could be a great ally, should the SPD either be entirely excluded from government or embrace a radical rightward shift. ?]


@bourgeois
subtitle: -1 resources
view-if: dbp_exist or csvd_exist or wp_exist or cnblp_exist
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; dbp_relation += 4*(1 - dissent); csvd_relation += 4*(1 - dissent); wp_relation += 4*(1 - dissent); cnblp_relation += 4*(1 - dissent)

We have improved our relations with some smaller bourgeois parties.


@ddp_alone

Whether it is because we *cannot* or *will not*, we do not make ties with other parties at this moment.

- @return: Continue...
